<title>NEW ZEALAND: U.S. fund reduces stake in Sky City.</title>
<headline>U.S. fund reduces stake in Sky City.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Massachusetts Financial Services Co has reduced its stake in casino operator Sky City Ltd to 4.13 percent from 7.10 percent, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
